AM Encyclopaedia
================

An offline edition of Albert G. Mackey's "An Encyclopaedia of Freemasonry
and Its Kindred Sciences", new and revised edition prepared by William J.
Hughan and Edward L. Hawkins (The Masonic History Company, 1914).

Compiled for the Brethren's reference by Arnie T.


The book itself is in the public domain
---------------------------------------

Mackey died in 1881 and this edition was published in 1914, so the text of
the encyclopaedia is in the public domain. Nothing here takes that away, and
nothing here is a claim over Mackey's words. Anyone may copy the underlying
work freely, from this edition or from any other.


