What it is not
--------------

The text was read from a scan by machine and checked against a second
printing of the same edition. It will contain errors of recognition. It has
no official standing, and it is neither published nor endorsed by any Grand
Lodge or other Masonic body. Where accuracy matters, consult the printed
edition.

Provided as is, without warranty of any kind.
